title: Shuffle Leadership
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0 and difficulty >= 0 and CHP_party_leader == "Ecevit"
on-arrival: month_activities += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 8;
card-image: img/cumhuriyet3.jpg
go-to: rm_main

Changing the leadership of the party is painful, but perhaps it is necessary to adapt to changing circumstances.

Removing members will increase dissent from their faction of the party, while selecting members will increase a faction's strength.

- @rm_main: Remove members
- @add_advisors: Add members
- @remove_none: Don't change members.
- @easy_discard


###################### removing leaders

@rm_main
title: Remove members.
tags: kemalist_marxist_advisor, left_kemalist_advisor, orthodox_kemalist_advisor, right_kemalist_advisor, nonfactional_advisor 
frequency: 1

- #remove_advisor
- @add_advisors: Add members

@remove_none
title: Stop changing members.
go-to: root
tags: remove_advisor


@remove_inonu
title: Remove İnönü
view-if: inonu_advisor = 1 and party_leader_id != "inonu"
on-arrival: inonu_advisor = 0; orthodox_kemalists_dissent += 10; n_advisors -= 1
tags: remove_advisor
go-to: rm_main

İnönü has been removed as a member. The Reformist Kemalist faction deeply disapproves.

